  "notes": "The municipal Gatehouse heritage review specifies two storeys, reinforced concrete, battlemented towers, lancet and segmental windows and the formal stair. The provincial study and native heritage record identify the stone Gaol Block with mansard roof. Municipal and regional park operations records identify the surviving Wharf Warehouse."
